<title>BELARUS: TABLE-Belarus June PPI 4.1 pct vs 4.9 pct in May.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Belarus June PPI 4.1 pct vs 4.9 pct in May.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarus producer price index (PPI) rose 4.1 percent in June against 4.9 percent in May, according to Statistics Ministry data released on Thursday.</p>
<p>The ministry said producer prices in the first half of this year had risen 63.5 percent, against 43.4 percent in the first six months of 1996.</p>
<p>    BELARUS PRODUCER PRICES	 June 97   May 97 June 96</p>
<p>    month/month pct change	    +4.1	+4.9   +2.8</p>
<p>    year/year			    +95.0     +92.5  +34.1</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom, +380 44 244 9150</p>
